  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ADDED\n- Mac Catalyst is now fully supported: the no-op stub was replaced by the real RevenueCat implementation shared with iOS (offerings, purchases, restore, customer info, trial eligibility, subscriber attributes). Requires `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.iOS` 5.72.0.3, whose xcframework ships a Mac Catalyst slice built from source with `BYPASS_SIMULATED_STORE_RELEASE_CHECK`, so Test Store `test_` API keys work in Release builds on Catalyst too. Thanks @JoacimWall! #48 #113",
